            <div xml:id="m-6394df51-25c2-48d1-b049-948476ab4eac">
              <lg xml:id="m-a0223fdc-bc2e-4395-b52b-766dfe192017">
                <l xml:id="m-39452edc-9bed-4ff0-a604-4beae5788c3a" facs="#m-b0ebb777-9826-4a98-b7b7-1aaa6f6034f1" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-fd735117-5908-498e-8c16-552b375d7670" facs="#m-98b40799-d4b5-405e-bc5c-fcb55f5da974" label="ambiguous">322</l><l xml:id="m-6a17ad1b-c1c0-4b4c-a34a-9216c81070f8" facs="#m-cf06fa75-b479-4908-9c76-955768dce3a7" label="lyrics-like">mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b4d9857-ac33-4b3a-a505-9874440c69c9" facs="#m-3d8ba07e-aeae-4a9a-a4cb-6e6abd1a5483" label="lyrics-like">ét-e- nim u-nivérsi qui te exspé-ctant, non</l><l xml:id="m-b1481f86-881e-4748-b092-38ccb60b215f" facs="#m-8c88ef44-9b32-4b30-8328-f146e160f211" label="lyrics-like">confun- dén- tur.</l><l xml:id="m-b3dc1452-b5a7-4216-8cce-550d135d65ed" facs="#m-4866048f-baf3-4ef9-9a54-312838e326f9" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-215d09b5-4d44-4041-98d8-3c11e8e80419" facs="#m-10fab1fe-c237-42e1-afa6-a3bbf81d0381" label="lyrics-like">KAec sacra nos, Dómine, poténti! ciant purióres venire principium.</l><l xml:id="m-7ef52e44-4062-4629-8792-394da6d3b572" facs="#m-323194f9-0e95-479e-8e0c-4472096a030f" label="lyrics-like">At virtúte mundátos, ad suum fá-l Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d6696221-a4b9-47dd-8233-85f807ed62ac" facs="#m-ade9f0b0-24e2-421b-bed1-b968e919a6d4" label="text-like">or our Lady.</l><l xml:id="m-6c65dd6f-44b4-4df8-a708-53285c2345f9" facs="#m-f144b92b-cdbb-4001-9db6-98f8ee6fcbb1" label="lyrics-like">N méntibus nostris, quaésumus ]confitémur: per ejus salutíferae re¬</l><l xml:id="m-58129a44-e667-4922-81cd-6aba09e3af12" facs="#m-2d5aa494-267e-40af-aa56-e449cc179782" label="lyrics-like">I Dómine, verae fidei sacraménta surrectiónis poténtiam, ad aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7e7379f-7320-4a5f-8c70-dd3686a88d8a" facs="#m-37faa9d1-9d1b-4c43-aef2-77916931cc3d" label="lyrics-like">confirma: ut, qui concéptum de l nam mereámur pervenire laetitiam.</l><l xml:id="m-5be1541f-2534-4f54-82e1-c9abaae0aa58" facs="#m-b56d8558-3fbd-47bf-99ef-fb4caaa00e6c" label="lyrics-like">Virgine Deum verum et hóminem (Per eúmdem Dóminum.)</l><l xml:id="m-09e7de4d-ddb9-406e-92de-b4c8c903bb0b" facs="#m-67ad63ff-9e0d-4a10-898b-d95a6544bb50" label="text-like">Against the persecutors of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-8fa8d4b9-b3fd-4bea-b6a7-5ef89de9613d" facs="#m-b0aa197a-41ac-4751-83e8-4e5e94370042" label="lyrics-like">DRótege nos, Dómine, tuis my-] bus inhaeréntes, et córpore tibi fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-cafb6678-166b-4e5e-810a-0569d3293eff" facs="#m-9da37dec-8b9c-4aa5-996c-a6d1a7cd15e9" label="lyrics-like">Lstériis serviéntes : ut divinis re-mulémur et mente. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e94951db-cf5c-4451-80ba-39874121d52e" facs="#m-d893babd-6649-45e4-ba1a-e4f9df8f5c76" label="text-like">or</l><l xml:id="m-8d6d9a58-8eda-41d6-aba7-b6e510157662" facs="#m-61e50964-7105-4f54-8322-cb18ecae7ee1" label="text-like">For the Pope.</l><l xml:id="m-05ee4451-bbc9-49a1-a735-6d992133be18" facs="#m-49598a5e-fff1-4140-8162-fdb0bbe485c2" label="lyrics-like">Blátis, quaésumus Dómine, pla¬ tuae pracésse voluisti, assídua pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9053615-d2d6-4ced-b814-2e0a29f089c0" facs="#m-e286c1c0-5058-4de9-8f1e-7010750c44b2" label="lyrics-like">U cáre munéribus: et fámulum</l><l xml:id="m-ab167431-d86b-4c3e-b499-55628f692266" facs="#m-a147eca5-c4ba-427f-a33e-1501b303bcd7" label="lyrics-like">tectióne gubérna. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-021fd3a1-5b25-4191-b7dd-5282dde577f1" facs="#m-9fccc890-8934-45f5-add4-a07b0b1d53f2" label="lyrics-like">tuum N. quem pastórem Ecclésiae</l><l xml:id="m-41807c5d-33bd-4d54-9d2c-fba2c0b7c639" facs="#m-49350c5c-d512-4ecd-b371-be35b19fcb88" label="text-like">Preface of the Blessed Trinity, p. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-c86f9068-0bcc-4e33-9539-f32f086fc035" facs="#m-5767f628-7841-4a61-a258-e1101f68a8df" label="text-like">The Choir.</l><l xml:id="m-38007932-bb4e-49ab-a865-10b237b4a29d" facs="#m-20685790-6c89-456e-8ad2-cfb22548800a" label="text-like">The Cantors.</l><l xml:id="m-828e1a29-b462-41be-b8f0-190f0ff4fed3" facs="#m-5307404f-d71f-4788-83d8-b87c1f09af6e" label="ambiguous">comm.!</l><l xml:id="m-af015aae-4ef0-4ce7-be8a-0f164b18bd63" facs="#m-b6aa6dc3-80a6-4bf0-96aa-48e897957bdb" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-93fcdce8-7e05-45fc-8a82-8d9edac165b8" facs="#m-8a6113dc-89fa-4433-be91-a3ff4f42357e" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-dee09822-7539-41a7-b058-51048d941292" facs="#m-ff28e4f0-4cf7-459c-89f3-945554a96d4d" label="lyrics-like">"dá-bit be-nigni-tá- tem: et tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-147dd9b1-6792-4024-91a1-0adf76f7d939" facs="#m-892f827b-d830-48a2-a39e-0a4e64392a59" label="ambiguous">Omi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-59f41a4a-8891-489f-9d37-d45b8fc46cfc" facs="#m-879960e5-90b3-4982-b459-cca3db553d0c" label="ambiguous">bit</l><l xml:id="m-efdadd11-37fa-48f0-855a-22309ff4b6be" facs="#m-8dfc1720-51e2-4a7f-a651-d3ff2f917a14" label="lyrics-like">ra nóstra dá¬</l><l xml:id="m-798776ca-724c-42bd-8f2f-85ba3bb5317c" facs="#m-afb20154-e95c-4eb7-a541-78ee3a401f59" label="lyrics-like">frúctum sú- um.</l><l xml:id="m-3f223b07-3097-447d-980e-1b2affb51071" facs="#m-866d088e-f659-49bb-9201-d9d45f84683a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-75b89fd4-bdbc-41b0-8480-16c5628a2895" facs="#m-41173d54-7b76-4ac7-87a3-7ad9a438b060" label="lyrics-like">NUscipiámus, Dómine, misericór- émnia cóngruis honóribus praece¬</l><l xml:id="m-db734916-0eaf-403d-8d24-0c264cdf68e8" facs="#m-ba23c79d-0f6a-4626-b58a-8ccf23ba29b1" label="lyrics-like">Ddiam tuam in médio templi tui :</l><l xml:id="m-5cdb117e-7023-4b84-8205-81b9b7326e2d" facs="#m-876b4c90-240a-407f-ae0c-0d7892f37380" label="lyrics-like">dámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-40e8348d-db51-4b7d-a1c0-0abc841ba6aa" facs="#m-83a66ea9-1b1a-4217-879e-51f51313db30" label="lyrics-like">ut reparatiónis nostrae ventúra sol¬</l><l xml:id="m-cdfa492e-18d6-45de-aefd-01763f1c1db9" facs="#m-2db9b88a-bf04-473a-99c2-c09f8ca75195" label="text-like">of our Lady.</l><l xml:id="m-3d376a82-0f33-4246-b8aa-bebcd34e9f60" facs="#m-15bad929-19a9-485f-a1a0-823c3e44eec3" label="lyrics-like">(Rátiam tuam, quaésumus Dómi- per passiónem eius et crucem, ad</l><l xml:id="m-1797d130-988b-415e-bc74-531583f7f64b" facs="#m-2e9b055d-ed81-4201-bca4-3731854ea31d" label="lyrics-like">( ne, méntibus nostris infúnde:</l><l xml:id="m-88c4b61b-bce7-48db-a68d-9dfcb5c116b4" facs="#m-1ef1fd7b-4904-4b35-a6db-aaf9569bdd76" label="lyrics-like">resurrectiónis glóriam perducámur.</l><l xml:id="m-bc6df1d0-416b-441f-ae20-b558a2cb4c93" facs="#m-81c113dc-91f6-49ca-a627-648cf0b26388" label="lyrics-like">ut qui, Angelo nuntiánte, Christi</l><l xml:id="m-261b3f78-4eda-4f1f-a96e-c0c32f5296a9" facs="#m-ef73b0ba-6b90-42d4-8711-c0221881f3ec" label="lyrics-like">(Per eúmdem Dóminum.)</l><l xml:id="m-bdaced45-889a-4030-8113-89b380a58d00" facs="#m-5e3bd726-a384-42be-9b11-702f30ca4e71" label="lyrics-like">Fslij tui incarnatiónem cognóvimus;</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>